					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This was interesting compared of how we see 682 as an nigh-omniscient immortal monster with a straight-cynical viewpoint that confuses others of that category?</p> <p>However, considering that 9-12% of the fanbase does not see 682's character, there is a horrendous amount of character corruption on different wiki.net forums like Space-Battles viewing him as a inept alien gaurd dog abandoned by its owner while said owner was intoxicated.</p> 
				 	]]>
